# A visit from end to end: read a board, walk, turn, look at the map, pause, save, load the
# save twice while the visit runs, save with F5, quit from the pause menu.
# Run from the build directory (build/ or build-asan/), nothing on the speakers:
#   SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen SDL_AUDIODRIVER=dummy ./zoo-simulator --stand board:0 --frames 400 \
#       --lockstep --saves ../build-probe/saves --script ../tests/game/visit_save_load.script
# Expect, in this order: "zoo: saved" (pause menu), "zoo: loaded" twice, "zoo: saved" (F5),
# and the process leaving with status 0 before frame 400 (the Quit button).
5 key E
20 shot ../build-probe/shots/visit-board.png
30 key E
36 hold W
80 release W
82 look 400 0 20
106 hold A
130 release A
134 key M
146 shot ../build-probe/shots/visit-map.png
150 key M
156 key Escape
166 shot ../build-probe/shots/visit-paused.png
168 click 640 309
180 click 640 355
190 shot ../build-probe/shots/visit-load-list.png
192 click 640 215
215 hold W
240 release W
244 key Escape
252 click 640 355
262 click 640 215
285 look -300 40 12
300 key F5
310 shot ../build-probe/shots/visit-after-loads.png
316 key Escape
326 click 640 493
